{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-22T20:42:05.886Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"03c1452e77ca585f8df9e4ee","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-22T20:42:05.886Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"All five orchestrator findings are implemented. Invalid and dangling confirmation records become attributable issues rather than exceptions in review consumers. Independent roots must agree regardless of verdict origin; canonical ownership follows decision timestamps, later decisions and retained disagreements remain visible after replay/reverse links, and changed imported decisions advance their time without relabeling import provenance. Verdict evidence and fields use one atomic SDK update on the stable observation, with typed missing-item remedies. SDK withdrawal is off by default and requires snapshotComplete=true plus exact unfiltered snapshot coverage; the trusted GitHub command supplies that assertion. Proposal hashes include titles and full comments. Targeted lineage suites passed 13/13 before the added import-time/missing-target cases; targeted lineage modules measured 100/100/100/100, 30 source files have full docstrings, and duplication remains zero. Final targeted checks, behavioral reverts and full CI release gates follow."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-22T20:42:05.886Z"}],"before_hash":"d44860cbabf24cac8b9f7d27835621aaac095b12da5f3c8eb49c92d399378aa0","after_hash":"f55080b16f74d3191b3677c42aa58d41f714e11ef69c26efe9b6ad06f64c541f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","reso